WEBVTT

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.110
What is the emperor of Zoble 
doing in a place like this?

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:18.340
Why have you come to see 
us... or rather, to see him?

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.720
For what reason?

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.660
And he's... a god?

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:22.870
God...

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:48.050
Damn it. That really hurt, you asshole!

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:51.930
You're a lot stronger than I had thought.

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:54.280
This might be quite the workout 
for an old timer like me.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:59.780
Go ahead. Come at me again. Or would you 
rather run crying to your friend?

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:02.950
Nobody said anything about 
running, you piece of shit!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:16.020
<b><i>The Idaten Deities
</i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hKnow Only Peace</b>

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.000
<b><i>The Idaten Deities
</i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hKnow Only Peace</b>

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.510
This is so irritating...

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.640
I don't think they'll be 
coming back this time.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.730
Did she do all that by swinging a sword?!

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.650
What the hell?! How big of a 
monster can one person be?!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.920
Still, I knew from the beginning 
that I couldn't win...

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.350
Let's see how much time of yours I can waste.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:05.120
Damn it. What are these blasted strings?!

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:09.540
Looking a bit more closely, 
the strings are attached to them...

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:14.040
Maybe they're all being controlled 
by a main body, somewhere else?

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.950
That's right! What you've been 
fighting are merely my marionettes!

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:22.300
You have to defeat me if you 
want to end this battle!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.060
Then you're the one behind this!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.020
My face! Ow, my face!

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.880
You fell right for that one!

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.480
I think I'll call it the 
Netted Face Shredder!

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:36.900
I've had enough of this—

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:39.070
What the?!

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:41.320
My arm just flew off!

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:45.050
She is... incredibly good 
at falling for traps.

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:46.780
Could I...

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:49.290
actually win this, if I play my cards right?

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:53.820
Another day, another search for 
baldy Barcode, the giant old lady,

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:56.430
and the pigtailed bondage gal.

00:03:56.820 --> 00:04:00.550
<i>Everything that Prontea sees is 
transmitted, via electronic signal,</i>

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:05.190
<i>to his PC at home, which is then 
displayed for General Piscalat.</i>

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.060
No. No. No.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.060
No.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:13.290
No. No. No. No.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.910
Is it me, or are you treating 
this like an assembly line worker

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.060
No. No.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.060
who's looking for faulty products?

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:16.840
Pipe down.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.730
Wait, how many people resembling 
Miku have you seen?

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.580
Only the one.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.490
Miku

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.490
I doubt there's a lot of people 
with that kind of fashion sense.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.780
Exactly. So, how do you explain her?

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.090
It's a bit too exact to 
just be a coincidence.

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:33.760
A decoy?

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:36.860
Yeah. The question is, why?

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.440
Okay, I'll go have a chat with her.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:43.760
I need to borrow you for a sec.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:44.950
Excuse me?

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:49.180
What is this?! What is this?!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.480
Stop screaming!

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:53.640
If you're human, you won't be harmed, 
so simmer down a little!

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.810
We need to get out of here!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:05.200
No. I...

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.700
I'm going to bear witness to this.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:18.250
Come on, pops, you're not gonna sprout 
tentacles or shapeshift or anything?

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:21.020
<i>He regenerates too fast.</i>

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.300
<i>The longer this goes on, 
the more of a disadvantage for me.</i>

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:35.310
<b>#8 Idaten</b>

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:28.100
I can't do that. 
I'm just good in a straight-up fight.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.840
Which I imagine suits you perfectly. 
No tricks or gimmicks involved.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:33.610
True enough.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:34.750
Let's do this!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:38.260
<i>I'd have no chance if he 
capitalized on his speed</i>

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.180
<i>and healing to draw the battle out...</i>

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:41.360
<i>What a simpleton.</i>

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:48.980
You didn't need to come here. 
Your side would've won the war, either way.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:54.040
Screw that. You expect me to hide 
behind Granny my whole life?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:59.790
By the way, you sure you don't 
wanna pull that arm out, pops?!

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:04.590
Shit, this actually hurts really bad.

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.220
You take a wound like that, 
and it only hurts?

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:11.180
You're not done yet, are you?

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.590
No. Come at me.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.960
<i>I think this is as far as I go...</i>

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.730
Hey, what's wrong? You dead?

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:24.400
Why don't you try and get me again?

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:31.370
I came out here half ready to die, 
but I think I might actually pull this off.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.580
Damn you...

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:41.370
Your roundabout way of fighting is 
starting to seriously tick me off!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:45.680
<i>Wait, what?! What the hell?! 
How did she regenerate so quickly?!</i>

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.220
What are you trying to do by 
getting wound up yourself?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.910
You can't even use that sword, now!

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:57.350
Really? Then maybe I'll get 
a little more wound up!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.940
Th-This is bad! I have to untangle my hair and—

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.540
That should be all of the decoys, 
along with the real body.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.580
And now I'll cut through it all at once!

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.710
Master is really going wild out there.

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.250
You seem to be the only one left.

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.200
Are you the real body?

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.480
Looks like you're done...

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.970
Then I win.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:52.680
<i>Good grief... he actually ran 
off, without finishing me.</i>

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:56.580
<i>It seems he only cares about 
whether he wins or not.</i>

00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:01.330
I'd recommend preparing 
a nuclear missile launch.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:06.290
Although even if it's effective, 
we'd still end up dying in the process...

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:14.680
Your Lordship, I also told my 
own children to flee beforehand.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:21.940
<i>Not yet...</i>

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.640
<i>It's not really over yet.</i>

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.230
What do you think you're doing?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.610
Isn't it obvious?!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.290
Your wounds need to be 
treated, or you'll die!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.470
You've really taken the whole 
"good person" thing to heart, haven't you?

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:44.330
There's no point, though. 
I weigh over 500 kg.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.790
Ow...

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.500
Leave me and get out of here.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.980
Dying after being flashed by 
a young woman won't be so bad.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.960
Please, stop joking around!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.670
That's a good reaction.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.320
You know, after 20 years,

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:02.680
my wife still insists we turn the 
lights out when we go to bed.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:06.520
Women with some sense of 
modesty really are the best.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.440
I've never appreciated 
the way Miku does things.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.710
Emperor Takeshita...

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:15.100
You were fighting in a way to avoid the 
prisoners being hurt in the crossfire.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.450
You could've taken us as hostages...

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.830
Even now, regardless of what you're saying,

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.580
you're trying to make sure I get to safety.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.220
To me...

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:27.410
You don't seem like a bad person.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:36.340
Damn it... I'm not healing fast enough.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.220
What the hell's that?

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.390
Emperor Takeshita!

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.390
One last word of warning...

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:52.200
I'm sure you've realized this, 
but we're not human.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.980
Which means there's no hope 
for peace between our peoples.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:10:01.160
Pray all you want, but the human hunts 
will resume again, sooner or later.

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:05.070
If you don't want to be caught 
again, flee to Hotaena.

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:10.170
Your life's short enough, you should 
be able to live it in peace.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.010
What are you saying?

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:19.250
Even if you're not human, your concern 
for others shows we can coexist...

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:28.210
I am so powerless.

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:31.730
When I was attacked...

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:34.280
When I was taken away, and locked up.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.970
I did nothing myself, I only prayed...

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:44.850
Even though a god came to save us, 
and was hurt in the process!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.640
<i>She has the wrong idea, there.</i>

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:50.620
But I can't even carry 
the wounded to safety...

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:57.350
<i>Prayer will accomplish 
nothing. I want power...</i>

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:01.430
<i>The power to protect people, 
with my own hands.</i>

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:05.430
If only I had power like that god...

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:13.980
<i>There are three criteria 
for an Idaten manifesting:</i>

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:18.820
<i>A large volume of thoughts, a long period 
of time, and a desire for salvation.</i>

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:24.220
<i>Here in the Zoble Empire, 
all three criteria have been met.</i>

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:32.060
<i>And the appearance, sex, name, 
and personality of an Idaten...</i>

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:37.670
<i>will be based off the most 
potent source of thoughts,</i>

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.170
<i>at the moment of their manifestation.</i>

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.360
What the hell are you doing here?

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:53.010
Um, are you okay? You seem to be hurt.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:55.880
Is that a joke?! 
You saw the whole damn thing!

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:59.110
I don't know what you mean! You've got 
the wrong person! I didn't see anything!

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:01.360
<i>Shit... my body...</i>

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.210
What was that?!

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:09.750
<i>This speed... is she...</i>

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.750
I want answers before I kill you.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.290
Where is this Demon Lord, Over-M?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.320
Or is it you?

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:23.220
Demon Lord Over-M? How should I know?

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:27.640
You're eight hundred years old, and you 
expect me to know something you don't?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.630
I might not know him, but he 
brings something to mind...

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:34.360
His naming sense reminds me a 
great deal of my Grandfather...

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:37.720
He'd call one demon Super H 
because it was super hard!

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:41.650
Or another demon who's weak, cow-like, 
and preyed upon the others as food,

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:43.400
Gyudon-kun!

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:48.170
This seems to be a low-level demon, 
the kind that would be used for food...

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:53.040
And since he's treated like a disposable 
source of food, like a beef bowl,

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.290
why don't we call him Gyudo-kun?

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.790
Uh... I don't see why not.

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.670
<i>Could it really be a coincidence?</i>

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:07.870
Now, this is a fascinating subject. Would 
you mind letting me join the discussion?

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:09.270
Who are you?!

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:09.890
Your Lord—

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.610
<i>I should keep quiet, for now.</i>

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:18.650
Rin, watching you fight stirred some 
memories the origins of which I am unsure of.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:21.650
I just had to speak to you in person.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:24.460
How do you know my name—

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:27.320
Is that sword the same kind that Sukis used?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.310
Someone who's as awkward as you,

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:34.890
on top of running from fights, 
couldn't produce one of these!

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:38.790
If you're dead set on it, though, 
swing this one around every day.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:43.960
Sukis-san! Stop making fun of me!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.060
One day, I know I'll...

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:50.390
How do you know that?

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:57.360
I remember you being a frail crybaby, 
for some reason, as well.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.740
Grandfather... everyone...

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:13.070
Since you've been gone, I've... I've...

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:18.090
Who are you?! How do you know these things?!

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:20.710
A good question. I have no clue, myself.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:23.460
But I keep remembering more and more...

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:28.460
You would always flee from the demons, 
but you hated being alone even more,

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:32.070
so you would insist on heading into battle...

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.220
Don't leave me!

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:36.240
I'm going with you!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:39.600
<i>How does he know this?!</i>

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:44.190
<i>She's stopped moving? She's wide open, too.</i>

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:48.710
<i>During the battle, I came up
 with a way to beat her.</i>

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:50.950
<i>But I'll only get one shot at it.</i>

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:57.050
Like I said, I have no idea 
where Miku-sama went after that!

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:58.850
What do you think?

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:00.560
There's only one thing that makes sense.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.640
She fled independently, to save her own skin.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:07.600
There'd be no point in interrogating the 
other demons even if we captured them.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:09.550
<i>So, you're saying...</i>

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.490
She managed to escape.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:17.440
Well, that's unfortunate. I can see now 
why General Piscalat was so wary of her.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.480
An excellent strategic choice.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.980
<i>I've got Biarov and Barcode.</i>

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:26.920
G-General Neput... why would you do this?

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:27.690
Put a sock in it!

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.820
You're gonna go through the same thing, 
so you'll know exactly why, soon enough.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:34.570
I see. In that case, 
hand Barcode over to Prontea-san.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:38.210
As for prime minister Biarov, 
give him a brief explanation

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:40.630
and then see to it that he gets to safety.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:41.770
Copy that.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:45.540
What exactly is the meaning of this, Neput?

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.430
What do you intend on doing with me?!

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.520
Once this is over, you're gonna rebuild
 the country for the sake of it's people,

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.050
and the whole world.

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:58.110
Hayato's headed this way, too.

00:15:58.110 --> 00:15:59.670
Do you think something happened?

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:01.500
Hey, sorry about the delay.

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.570
Here's your Barcode-san.

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:08.420
It looks like Hayato is headed this way, too... 
Do you have any idea what happened?

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.990
Nope. I have a hard time 
imagining him coming back,

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:12.780
even if he was on the verge of dying...

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.770
Where's he at?

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.210
Still in this area.

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.900
That's a bit slow...

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:21.170
Come on. Can't you go a little faster?

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:25.250
I'm sorry, no! 
I've never run on water before.

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:27.670
What the—?!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.600
It's fine. She's on our side.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:32.970
Oh, I see! A new Idaten!

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:34.290
An Idaten?

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:37.520
True enough. Zoble did meet all the 
criteria for one manifesting...

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:41.830
I've got surgery to perform. 
Paula, take care of things here.

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.230
Yeah, got it!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.840
Hayato, you look like you 
had quite a struggle.

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:48.120
Were you up against Umeyo? Or the Emperor?

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.230
The Emperor, I think.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.180
Did you lose?

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:53.610
Man, shut up. I beat him.

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.460
I was gonna head back as soon 
as I handed her off to you guys.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:59.490
That works out nicely! 
So, what's your name, new girl?

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:03.000
Uh... Gill. It's Gill!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:06.040
Nice to meet you, Gill. I'm Prontea.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.840
Now, our hands are kind 
of full with this war...

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:12.340
Once things calm down a bit, 
we'll have a proper chat.

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:23.390
I hope the others were able to escape...

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:25.430
Hey!

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:28.480
Wh-Who are you?! 
When did you get behind me?!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.850
I kind of wanted to ask that.

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:32.860
Can you warp, or something?

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:33.360
Huh?

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:37.120
Wait... you are Gill, right?

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:40.260
Uh, yes. My name is Gilltina.

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:42.410
I usually answer to Gill, though...

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.120
How do you know my name?

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:47.180
<i>A lookalike? And a human?</i>

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:50.810
<i>The resemblance is too strong 
for it to be a coincidence...</i>

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.760
Excuse me, but are you a god—

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.520
I see. You must've run into Hayato-kun.

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:06.310
In that case, yes, I'm also a god.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:10.270
And if you're an ordinary human, 
that poses some interesting questions.

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.270
How could you?

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.820
You'd provide a new data sample 
regarding the manifestation of Idaten.

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.560
How could you do that?!

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:25.700
That's a demon. If I hadn't 
killed him, you would've died.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.660
But... still...

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:30.010
To end a life so casually...!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.140
Then would you still criticize 
me if I were weaker,

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:38.130
and fought a more desperate 
battle, but still won?

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:44.890
What exactly would I need 
to do to satisfy you, then?

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.210
I don't know!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.350
I might have died if you hadn't killed him...

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:54.400
But... taking an enemy's 
life so one-sidedly...

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.900
I just can't bear the sight of it!

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:02.680
<i>She's an interesting human, but her 
personality is pretty intensely troublesome.</i>

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:04.840
<i>So, what should I do?</i>

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.580
I'm sure that with the war,

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:10.170
there are many who were unable 
to escape, due to injuries...

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:14.030
But I'm unable to help them by myself.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.950
Please, god, grant me your—

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:20.930
Better to have her sleep 
until everything's over.

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:24.800
I doubt any style of warfare 
would satisfy your conscience.

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:27.430
Ignorance is bliss.

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:31.700
<i>His memories are patchy... there's 
not much of a resemblance, either.</i>

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:35.150
<i>But he knows things only 
Grandfather could know...</i>

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.940
<i>And there are little 
habits that are the same.</i>

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:45.100
Is that you, Grandfather?!

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:52.040
<i>As powerful as your attacks are, 
your defense is terrible!</i>

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:55.710
<i>It's so bad that even using a little 
of your own strength against you</i>

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.420
<i>makes a limb fly off!</i>

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.420
<i>You can't even withstand the 
impact of your own attacks!</i>

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:04.800
<i>Now, have a taste of one 
of those attacks, and die!</i>

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:15.320
<i>That was way stronger than I expected... 
I accidentally blew the Demon Lord away.</i>

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:19.090
<i>Well, he's a robot, so he'll 
probably be fine... right?</i>

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:23.450
<i>But I need to strike again... 
need to get rid of her or—</i>

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.500
<i>Oh, Grandfather...</i>

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:41.760
<i>I've missed you... for so long...</i>

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:44.790
<i>Could we be... together again?</i>

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.770
Master?

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:54.490
<i>Six hours after Takeshita 
and Brandy were defeated,</i>

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.520
<i>Piscalat and Cory joined the assault.</i>

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.400
<i>Hayato would return to the front lines,</i>

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:03.650
<i>and Barcode would take over 
operations from Piscalat.</i>

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.910
<i>Barcode was able to locate 
the remaining demons,</i>

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.010
<i>which Prontea and Hayato then eliminated.</i>

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:13.410
<i>The war was, effectively, over.</i>

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:20.330
Looks like we're starting 
over from scratch, huh?
